  "extractionNotes": "Granted period printed in a ZUS note on the first page (1-week paternity part, 2026-07-13..2026-07-19); the leave request to the employer asks for paternity leave in parts. Leave application to the employer dated 2026-07-03 (Z-3); the ZAO is dated 2026-08-06, after the leave ended, and is used as asOf. The child's birth date is not legible, so event.date is omitted with occurred = true. Z-3 salary table 2025-07..2026-06 (12 full months before the leave): constant contractual pay, no variable components. Column 9 deduction is 2.45% in most months because the annual pension/disability cap was exceeded; 13.71% in 2026-01 and 3.51% in 2026-02 (cap reached during February). contributionBase inferred equal to column 6. Rate not printed (100% inferred). Base and daily below are our computation with the per-month deduction, reported only; the benefit base has no upper cap."
